 add('school-stage','GROWING UP','The school showcase wants a cover. You brought an original.','The organiser says everyone knows the covers and nobody wants an awkward silence. Your name is already printed on the programme.',[
 option('Play the original and introduce its story','Performance +4 · Fans +12',{voice:4,fans:12},'A few classmates asked for the words afterwards.'),option('Build a medley with a short original section','Preparation +5 · Performance +2',{prep:5,voice:2},'The familiar opening gave the new song somewhere to land.'),option('Save it for a room that wants original songs','Happiness +4',{happiness:4},'You kept the song for a different first audience.')],age()<18);
