 add('small-venue-access','BEFORE DOORS','A fan asks whether the venue has step-free access.','The venue’s booking page says accessible. The entrance photograph shows three steps. Nobody on the booking email has checked.',[
 option('Call the venue and verify a usable entrance','Reputation +6 · Energy −4',{rep:6,energy:-4},'You published accurate access information instead of repeating the listing.'),option('Arrange and fund a suitable alternative room','Costs $150 · Reputation +8',{rep:8},'The promoter moved the performance to a room people could enter.',null,null,150),option('Ask the promoter to confirm details before sales continue','Reputation +4',{rep:4},'The access question became a requirement, not a footnote.')]);
