 add('sync-offer','A SCENE IN A FILM',`A film student wants “${t.title}” for the ending.`,`Their budget is tiny. The ending places the song over two friends leaving their hometown. They offer $180 for a limited screening licence, with your name in the credits.`,[
 option('Agree to the limited licence','Cash +$180 · Attention +3',{cash:180,buzz:3},'The signed licence covered the student film screenings, not ownership of your song.'),option('Ask to see the final scene before agreeing','Reputation +3 · Preparation +4',{rep:3,prep:4},'The director welcomed a conversation about what the scene meant.'),option('Decline because the scene changes the lyric’s meaning','Happiness +4',{happiness:4},'You kept the song out of a context that did not feel right.')]);
